WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.880
Well, nothing says honesty like taking the fifth,

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:03.160
and Doc, let's try something.

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.200
What day of the week is it today?

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.120
On the advice of counsel,

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:10.080
I respectfully decline to answer based upon my rights

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.920
under the Fifth Amendment to the Constitution.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.280
Oh, color tie you're wearing.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.800
On the advice of counsel,

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.760
I respectfully decline to answer based upon my rights

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:21.960
under the Fifth Amendment to the Constitution.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:27.160
What color is the carpet in front of you?

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.540
On the advice of counsel,

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:31.600
I respectfully decline to answer based upon my rights

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.860
under the Fifth Amendment to the Constitution.

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:34.800
Let's just get one thing straight.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.840
You don't have any rights under the Fifth Amendment

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:39.600
because you've been pardoned, as you very well know,

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.260
as a Supreme Court has been clear for a century and more,

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:44.960
Brown versus Walker, 1896.

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.160
When he has been pardoned,

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:49.360
he may not stand upon his privilege.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.200
You know that,

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.300
your lawyers sitting behind you

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.800
now shifting nervously in their chairs, they know it.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.240
This isn't about the Constitution,

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:57.880
this isn't about the law, this is about contempt.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:01.640
For this body and contempt for the American people.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:03.040
But I think I know why you're doing it.

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:06.480
It's because you don't want to answer questions.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:09.600
It's because you did all kinds of terrible things.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:13.080
It's because during the pandemic, you got rich, didn't you?

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:16.120
You got rich while people were dying,

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:18.640
hundreds of thousands of Americans over a million

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.440
in the end and you were getting rich

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:21.960
and not only were you doing that,

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:26.080
you were using federal employees with taxpayer money

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:31.080
to apply for and solicit cash prizes for you personally,

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:35.160
cash prizes totaling over a million dollars.

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:38.080
You did all of that during the pandemic, didn't you?

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:40.440
That's a question.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:42.800
On the advice of counsel,

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:45.640
I respectfully decline to answer based upon my rights

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:47.840
under the Fifth Amendment to the Constitution.

